## Why This Is Asked
Tests depth in CGOA: thread affinity, TLS lifecycles, and cross-language safety. Highlights per-thread context handling when Go schedulers move goroutines between threads.

## Key Concepts
- CGO and runtime.LockOSThread
- C thread-local storage (TLS) and per-thread ctx
- Resource lifecycle and explicit cleanup
- Error propagation across language boundaries

## Code Example
